   "description": "Do you want to know where to fish? Where to leave your car? What kind of of a fly do you need? Just click here and read for free the guide for the district Sava 4 The district, which extends from Rakovník to the outflow of the Tržiška Bistrica River into the Sava. The district 4 already unites the rivers Sava Dolinka and Sava Bohinjka-and the united district is 23 km long."
